n"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.068, 0.297, 0.747, 0.341], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "From the root, follow the selection policy down to a leaf."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.069, 0.389, 0.267, 0.434], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "2. Expansion"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.068, 0.447, 0.75, 0.491], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Add one child for an action that has not been expanded."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.07, 0.539, 0.268, 0.583], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "3. Simulation"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.069, 0.597, 0.719, 0.686], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Run a playout from that child using the playout policy. The playout moves stay outside the stored tree."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.069, 0.734, 0.37, 0.781], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "4. Back-propagation"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.069, 0.792, 0.828, 0.837], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Update the visited path to the root. Repeat while time remains."}]}, {"type": "footer", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.918, 0.937, 0.983, 0.993], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "M"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 8, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.077, 0.097, 0.672, 0.157], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "The lecture’s Monte Carlo tree"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.07, 0.257, 0.307, 0.305], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Given snapshot"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.069, 0.348, 0.275, 0.533], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Each label is wins / playouts for the player whose turn it is."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.07, 0.618, 0.282, 0.703], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Light nodes: white Dark nodes: gray"}]}, {"type"