dx": 13, "blocks": [{"type": "doc_title", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.077, 0.096, 0.88, 0.161], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Selection policy: upper confidence bound"}], "level": 1}, {"type": "text", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.07, 0.247, 0.829, 0.298], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "UCB1(n) = U(n)/N(n) + C × √[log N(Parent(n)) / N(n)]", "styles": ["bold"]}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.07, 0.355, 0.509, 0.397], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "U(n): total utility of playouts through n"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.07, 0.399, 0.484, 0.44], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "N(n): number of playouts through n"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.071, 0.479, 0.251, 0.524], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Exploitation"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.07, 0.54, 0.79, 0.585], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "U(n)/N(n): mean utility for the player selecting at the parent."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.071, 0.655, 0.244, 0.699], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Exploration"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.07, 0.714, 0.58, 0.753], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "The bonus is larger for less-visited children."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.07, 0.757, 0.802, 0.799], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "C balances the two, usually 1.414 (√2). Use the natural log (ln)."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.07, 0.848, 0.499, 0.883], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "For win = 1 and loss = 0: U(n) = N(n) − W(n)."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.069, 0.883, 0.729, 0.918], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "W(n) counts wins for the player to move at child n. Assume no draws."}]}, {"type": "footer", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.919, 0.937, 0.982, 0.992], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "M"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 14, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.076, 0.097, 0.556, 0.155], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Worked UCB calculation"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.07, 0.235, 0.784, 0.279], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Use the tree after the Dark win: root 2/7, children 4/4 and 1/3."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.07, 0.303, 0.589, 0.345], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Reward convention: win = 1, loss = 0, no draws."}]}, {"type": "table", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.075, 0.359, 0.924, 0.769], "content": [{"type": "table_body", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.075, 0.359, 0.924, 0.769], "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>From Light's perspective</td><td>Left child</td><td>Right child</td></tr><tr><td>Light wins / playouts</td><td>0 / 4</td><td>2 / 3</td></tr><tr><td>Exploration bonus</td><td>√(2 ln 7 / 4)≈ 0.986</td><td>√(2 ln 7 / 3)≈ 1.139</td></tr><tr><td>UCB score</td><td>0 + 0.986= 0.986</td><td>2/3 + 1.139≈ 1.806</td></tr></tbody></table>"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.07, 0.791, 0.83, 0.839], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "UCB selects the right child for the next exploration step.", "styles": ["bold"]}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.069, 0.877, 0.755, 0.915], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "At the time limit, the lecture returns the root action with the most playouts."}]}, {"type": "footer", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.919, 0.937, 0.982, 0.993], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "M"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 15, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.077, 0.097, 0.766, 0.159], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Chance nodes and expectiminimax"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "table", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.074, 0.243, 0.925, 0.651], "content": [{"type": "table_body", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.074, 0.243, 0.925, 0.651], "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>Node type</td><td>Backup rule</td></tr><tr><td>Max</td><td>Largest child value</td></tr><tr><td>Min</td><td>Smallest child value</td></tr><tr><td>Chance</td><td>Σ P(outcome) × value(outcome)</td></tr></tbody></table>"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.07, 0.7, 0.48, 0.745], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Probabilities must sum to 1."}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.07, 0.789, 0.66, 0.832], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Use the same player’s utility throughout the tree."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.069, 0.833, 0.919, 0.878], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "A chance outcome follows its probability, rather than a player’s choice."}]}, {"type": "footer", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.919, 0.937, 0.982, 0.993], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "M"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 16, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.077, 0.097, 0.606, 0.159], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Practice 3: expectiminimax"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "image", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.069, 0.237, 0.903, 0.787], "content": [{"type": "image_body", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.069, 0.237, 0.903, 0.787], "content": ""}, {"type": "image_footnote", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.07, 0.813, 0.648, 0.857], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Find the root value and Max’s preferred move."}]}]}, {"type": "footer", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.918, 0.937, 0.984, 0.993], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "M"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 17, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.077, 0.097, 0.607, 0.157], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Practice 3: worked solution"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "image", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.068, 0.237, 0.903, 0.788], "content": [{"type": "image_body", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.068, 0.237, 0.903, 0.788], "content": ""}, {"type": "image_footnote", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.411, 0.803, 0.68, 0.845], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "B = 0.5(−5) + 0.5(5) = 0"}]}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.07, 0.803, 0.384, 0.845], "content": "\\mathsf {A} = 0. 8 (- 2 0) + 0. 2 (5